a","type":"swim","detail":"The long sandy bay 3 km from town, shallow and sheltered. Arvanitia, right under the old town, is gravel and quicker to reach.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.visitnafplio.com/beaches.html","https://nafplio.app/best-beaches","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece-guide/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Theatre of Epidaurus","type":"activity","detail":"A 4th century BC theatre half an hour away, the best preserved in Greece and still famous for carrying a whisper to the back row.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece","https://greeking.me/blog/greek-mainland/things-to-do-in-nafplio","https://www.itsalltriptome.com/what-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Archaeological Museum","type":"activity","detail":"In a Venetian warehouse on the main square, and worth it for one thing above all: a complete bronze suit of armour from nearby Mycenae.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":13,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece","https://travelthegreekway.com/best-things-to-do-in-nafplion-greece/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g319780-Activities-Nafplio_Argolis_Region_Peloponnese.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Nemea wine tasting","type":"experience","detail":"The Agiorgitiko heartland is an easy drive north, and the wineries take visitors.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":13,"urls":["https://wanderingwagars.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio/","https://travelthegreekway.com/best-things-to-do-in-nafplion-greece/","https://waylesstravelers.com/things-to-do-in-nafplio-greece/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Elliniko pyramid","type":"activity","detail":"12 km away","kind":"Ruins","sources":["commons","wikidata","wikipedia"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":3,"sources":["commons",